 morbius a biochemist played by geralito  who suffers from a rare blood disease  and tries to cure himself through  self-experimentation  of course the whole thing goes horribly  wrong and morbius contracts a form of  vampirism  in the comics this is accompanied by  typical vampire traits such as rampant  blood consumption and aversion to  sunlight the ability to fly  and superhuman fighting and healing  abilities on his somewhat tragic path  through life he later meets spider-man  and joins the legion of monsters  in addition to his existence as a  blood-sucking vampire he is also a  brilliant scientist who can even call  nobel prize for biochemistry his own by  the end of spider-man 3 at the latest  peter parker will finally return to sony  which will make a long-awaited clash  between morbius  and peter parker feasible for fans the  upcoming morbius will be directed by  daniel espinoza with the release day set  for march 19  2021 the next movie on our list is  marvel shangshi and the legend  of the ten rings the focus is on chiang  shi who is also called the master of  kung fu  in contrast to the big names like  captain america or spider-man chiang shi  is still relatively  unknown in the mcu as early as his  childhood the son of fu manchu already  trained in martial arts  he's thus superior to many mcu  colleagues thanks to his perfect mastery  of a wide variety of martial arts  even without superpowers it then turns  out in the comics that chengxi's father  is actually a villain who wants to take  over the world  whether the film takes up this  circumstance on a one-to-one basis is of  course a different question  the cast so far includes simul us shanxi  jolly liang chiwai as mandarin as well  as aquafina ronnie chiang michel hiwa  and he had unknown roles  the marvel blockbuster will be directed  by destin daniel [ __ ] who had his  breakthrough with the indie hit short  term 12  solent heroes the release of shanxi and  the legend of the tan rings is scheduled  for july 9th  2021 fairly little is known about our  next film doctor strange in the  multiverse of madness yet  in the recent past the headlines  surrounding the sequel to 2016's doctor  strange have tended to revolve around  the fact that  original director scott derrickson left  his post shortly before filming began  causing uncertainty in the production  fortunately however  the right man for the sequel was soon  found with sam raimi which is why the  loss of derek's as a director remains  bearable the cast currently only  includes benedict cumberbatch as dr  steven strange elizabeth olsen has won  the maximoff civital eg04 as mordo and  benedict wong  as wong an alleged villain is also said  to have been found and named nightmare  though this has not yet been officially  confirmed as producers by the way axe  director scott derricks and marvel boss  kevin feige are also still involved  after a recent postponement of the film  the new release date for doctor strange  and the multiverse of madness is set for  march 25th  2022 among many other films the sequel  to 2018's box office hit venom called  venom let there be carnage is coming up  this year  in the second part sony's anti-hero will  meet the villain cletus cassidy aka  carnage who was previously teased in the  first  part just like venom carnage is an alien  symbian that affects cassidy and gives  him even more mighty powers than his  counterpart  but that's not all the villain shriek  also has a say in the matter and  attempts to give venom a hard time with  a superhuman sonic powers  with tom hardy as venom michelle  williams is annoying woody harrelson as  cletus cassidy and naomi harris is  shriek  the nude movie should be more than well  cast there will be no stranger to the  director's chair either with the  director being andy  serkis you can find out exactly how the  confrontation between  venom and carnage will end as from june  25th  2021 in a cinema new you  we still have to wait over a year until  the release of the batman  since the dc fandom in august in  particular it has become clear to many  fans that the wait will most likely be  worth it after yet another postponement  a few months ago  according to director matt reeves the  new blockbuster with the dark knight  will be a mixture of mystery thriller  and detective story  by solving many murders the still young  bruce wayne then comes into contact with  a wide variety of super villains  with zoe kravitz's selena kyle paul dano  as the riddler and colin farrell's the  penguin  the dark knight already has quite a few  adversaries ahead of him  and those are just the most serious  threats bringing all these characters  together is certainly no  easy task but according to reeves it's  one of the most challenging and exciting  aspects of the new film  however the whole thing is not meant to  be a real origin story because reeves is  not interested in showing how bruce  becomes batman but rather how he copes  as a newcomer in the hostile world of  gotham city  based on what the people involved say  the story will be very close to the  comics  judging by the emphasis on batman's  ability as a detective  we are definitely eager to find out how  max reeves and his team will implement  the new story of the batman and we are  looking forward to the release on march  4th  2022 the now fourth  thor film is called love and thunder and  will be released shortly before the  batman in 2022  star director taika waititi is  responsible for the script and direction  while the cast includes natalie portman  as jane foster  tessa thompson as valkyrie chris  hemsworth as thor  and christian bale as the new villain so  far it is unclear whether there will be  a reunion with tom hiddleston as loki  after all he is currently still busy  with his own mcu series  meanwhile in an interview with yahoo  actress natalie portman revealed more  details about her character mighty thor  she said that she started exercising  since 