ily about  tom holland's new life as an  outed superhero particularly tricky is  the fact that not only does the whole  world know his identity but  everybody also believes him to be a  villain spider-man 3 will be directed by  john  watts returning to the roles will be tom  holland as peter parker  zendaya as mj and marisa tomei as may  parker  the signing of jaime foxx as the villain  electro caused  quite a stir after all he's actually  part of the sony universe and not the  mcu  to what extent the two universes will  collide and whether the film will even  lay the foundation for a brand new sony  universe  can be found out as of december 17 2021  and that's it for today's originals  episode now it's your turn  which movie are you looking forward to  the most and do you think its release  date is realistic  leave us a comment and see you next time  [Music]  foreign

